---

<section
  id="top"
  class="relative flex min-h-[100svh] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-10 bg-deck-side px-6 pb-24 pt-[env(safe-area-inset-top)] text-center text-white"
  aria-label="DeckIt"
>
  <div class="space-y-3" data-reveal>
    <h1 class="text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-7xl">DeckIt</h1>
    <p class="text-3xl font-medium text-deck-accent-soft sm:text-4xl">資料、できた。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="deckit-hero-copy max-w-2xl space-y-5" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
    <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#c8d4dc]" data-jp-wrap>
      Drive の資料から、<span class="deckit-em-dark">自分らしいスライド</span>をすぐ。
    </p>
    <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#c8d4dc]" data-jp-wrap>
      <span class="deckit-em-dark">Style</span> は相手に合わせて。<span class="deckit-em-dark">AI</span> がたたき台、あなたが仕上げて
      <span class="deckit-em-dark">Drive</span> に残す。
    </p>
  </div>

  <a
    href="#story"
    class="deckit-scroll-hint absolute bottom-[max(1.5rem,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-[#9fb0bc] transition-colors hover:text-deck-highlight"
    aria-label="下にスクロール"
  >
    <span>くわしく見る</span>
    <svg class="h-5 w-5 animate-bounce text-deck-highlight" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
    </svg>
  </a>
</section>
